    "mutation-identity": "Read-only static values; JS writable/configurable shared namespace vs immutable Dart const snapshot is explicit adaptation.",
    "errors": "Known present SDK properties and Dart compile-time fields read successfully; unknown names and mutation errors are outside this property scope.",
    "lifecycle-events": "Reading constants does not register listeners or dispatch events; event payload, behavior and lifecycle are separate OPEN contracts.",
    "dispatch": "Loaded pinned native alias identity and member descriptors plus exact Dart static field and map reads on three platform integrations."
